L.md` patterns to plugin paths only.\\n\\n**Hypothesis**: whichever tool/process produces `.claude/skills/*` copies of plugin skills should be checked \u2014 if it's meant to stay in sync automatically, that sync is broken; if it's a deliberate independent copy, it needs its own maintenance path.\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Quality vigilance concern from #3151 \u2014 orchestrator observation while independently verifying T9's dead-link repair during the SAM task-file-language refactor\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-08-29\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\\n## Additional Findings\\n\\n<div><sub>2026-08-29T01:34:25.051765Z</sub>\\n\\nAdditional instance found by the QG code-reviewer during #3151's complete-implementation cycle: `.claude/docs/workflow-architecture-diagram.md:8` has a \\\"Sources:\\\" citation line still pointing to `plugins/development-harness/docs/TASK_FILE_FORMAT.md` (deleted by #3151's T5). This is the SAME repo-root file whose JSON payload example and mechanism-description steps T11 already updated \u2014 T11's scope didn't extend to this header citation line, so it survived. Same fix pattern as the other three items already listed: remove or repoint the citation now that the file no longer exists.\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"2028ac3341e9b707a08538c230d7b5215e2b405ce4b07ea8484ec80fe6636e39\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABRWvh6A\"}"}